# Code aur config: repo mein LF, Windows checkout par git khud sambhal leta hai.
* text=auto

# .eml files ko git bilkul na chhede (line endings badalne se DKIM signature toot jata hai).
# "diff" ki wajah se PR mein farq phir bhi text ki tarah nazar aata hai.
*.eml -text diff

# Shell scripts container ke andar chalenge, hamesha LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
